      "comment": "STORM SISTER (5) struggled to get involved last start after missing the jump at Murray Bridge, but prior to that won by one length at Murray Bridge (22.51) beating Bedevilled in a Grade 6 on August 16. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from six starts. Can bounce back. WEBLEC SNIP (8) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 5.5 lengths fourth (20.54) last time in a Grade 4 at this track over 342m. Bold showing expected on best. CABAO NICKEL (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (20.25) in a Other at this track. Has a good record at this journey. Key player if finds best. PHANTOM CARAT (2) was in the money last start here at this trip - likely to feature again.",
